#string AMD_CBS_STR_DDR_HEALING_BIST                                            #language en-US    "DDR Healing BIST"
 #language x-AMI "CbsCmnMemHealingBistEnableBitMaskDdr"
#string AMD_CBS_STR_DDR_HEALING_BIST_HELP                                       #language en-US    "This item enables a full memory test. Please note that this is a memory content test and is separate and distinct from the MBIST test of Interface and Data Eye.\nPMU Mem BIST: this uses PMU firmware to test memory on all channels simultaneously. Failing memory will be repaired using soft or hard PPR depending on the PPR configuration.\nSelf-Healing Mem BIST: this runs the JEDEC DRAM self healing, if the device and DIMM support the feature. The DRAM will do a hard repair for failing memory.\nPMU and Self-Healing Mem BIST: this option runs the PMU Mem BIST then the Self-Healing Mem BIST tests sequentially."
#string AMD_CBS_STR_PMU_MEM_BIST                                                #language en-US    "PMU Mem BIST"
#string AMD_CBS_STR_SELF_HEALING_MEM_BIST                                       #language en-US    "Self-Healing Mem BIST"
#string AMD_CBS_STR_PMU_AND_SELF_HEALING_MEM_BIST                               #language en-US    "PMU and Self-Healing Mem BIST"
