#string AMD_CBS_STR_MCTP_MODE_HELP                                              #language en-US    "Option to configure how MCTP packets are routed.\n\n\nMCTP Bridge - Enables MCTP Endpoint Support and manually routes all unrouteable VDMs to the BMC via an internal MCTP Bridge.\n\nLegacy MCTP + MCTP Bridge - BIOS will enable MCTP Bridge when required based off the system configuration, otherwise BIOS will default to Legacy MCTP where MCTP endpoint support is disabled and the BMC will route MCTP packets directly to other MCTP endpoints through the processor root ports without an internal MCTP Bridge."
#string AMD_CBS_STR_MCTP_BRIDGE                                                 #language en-US    "MCTP Bridge"
#string AMD_CBS_STR_LEGACY_MCTP_MCTP_BRIDGE                                     #language en-US    "Legacy MCTP + MCTP Bridge"
