#string AMD_CBS_STR_IXC_TELEMETRY_PORTS_FENCE_CONTROL_HELP                      #language en-US    "Controls the Fencing off for I2C/I3C ports which are involved in DDR Telemetry. If this option is enabled, then the associated Ixc ports registers will be put in the secure region. \nNote: If this option is disabled, there is a risk of collision happening between x86 accessing IxC and PMFW running DDR Telemetry which can cause undefined behavior."
