#string AMD_CBS_STR_EGRESS_POISON_SEVERITY_HIGH                                 #language en-US    "Egress Poison Severity High"
 #language x-AMI "PcdEgressPoisonSeverityHi"
#string AMD_CBS_STR_EGRESS_POISON_SEVERITY_HIGH_HELP                            #language en-US    "Each bit set to 1 enables HIGH severity on the associated IOHC egress port. A bit of 0 indicates LOW severity."
#string AMD_CBS_STR_EGRESS_POISON_SEVERITY_LOW                                  #language en-US    "Egress Poison Severity Low"
 #language x-AMI "PcdEgressPoisonSeverityLo"
#string AMD_CBS_STR_EGRESS_POISON_SEVERITY_LOW_HELP                             #language en-US    "Each bit set to 1 enables HIGH severity on the associated IOHC egress port. A bit of 0 indicates LOW severity."
#string AMD_CBS_STR_EGRESS_POISON_MASK_HIGH                                     #language en-US    "Egress Poison Mask High"
 #language x-AMI "PcdAmdNbioEgressPoisonMaskHi"
#string AMD_CBS_STR_EGRESS_POISON_MASK_HIGH_HELP                                #language en-US    "These set the enable mask for masking of errors logged in EGRESS_POISON_STATUS. For each bit set to 1, errors are masked.  For each bit set to 0, errors trigger response actions."
#string AMD_CBS_STR_EGRESS_POISON_MASK_LOW                                      #language en-US    "Egress Poison Mask Low"
 #language x-AMI "PcdAmdNbioEgressPoisonMaskLo"
#string AMD_CBS_STR_EGRESS_POISON_MASK_LOW_HELP                                 #language en-US    "These set the enable mask for masking of errors logged in EGRESS_POISON_STATUS. For each bit set to 1, errors are masked.  For each bit set to 0, errors trigger response actions."
#string AMD_CBS_STR_UNCORRECTED_CONVERTED_TO_POISON_ENABLE_MASK_HIGH            #language en-US    "Uncorrected Converted to Poison Enable Mask High"
 #language x-AMI "PcdAmdNbioRASUcpMaskHi"
#string AMD_CBS_STR_UNCORRECTED_CONVERTED_TO_POISON_ENABLE_MASK_HIGH_HELP       #language en-US    "These set the enable mask for masking of uncorrectable parity errors on internal arrays.  For each bit set to 1, a system fatal error event is triggered for UCP errors on arrays associated with that egress port.  For each bit set to 0, errors are masked."
#string AMD_CBS_STR_UNCORRECTED_CONVERTED_TO_POISON_ENABLE_MASK_LOW             #language en-US    "Uncorrected Converted to Poison Enable Mask Low"
 #language x-AMI "PcdAmdNbioRASUcpMaskLo"
#string AMD_CBS_STR_UNCORRECTED_CONVERTED_TO_POISON_ENABLE_MASK_LOW_HELP        #language en-US    "These set the enable mask for masking of uncorrectable parity errors on internal arrays.  For each bit set to 1, a system fatal error event is triggered for UCP errors on arrays associated with that egress port.  For each bit set to 0, errors are masked."
