#string AMD_CBS_STR_ABL_CONSOLE_OUT_SERIAL_PORT_IO_CUSTOMIZED_HELP              #language en-US    "0:disabled. no supported ( default value ).\nplease input your eSPI UART io based in non zero value.\n\nAlso please make sure the selected eSPI IO base and length has been filled in APCB_FCH_TYPE_ESPI_INIT or APCB_FCH_TYPE_ESPI1_INIT EspiInitConfiguration table.\n"
